# Transient copies the build's `make install` step moves into Programs/
# right after -- src/bin/SingleGalaxyFitter was accidentally committed in
# the initial snapshot (present mid-build at commit time); this stops it
# from recurring.
src/bin/BootStrapSampler
src/bin/SingleGalaxyFitter

# DCPjobData/ is a live working directory the JS/DCP dispatch path
# dumps-then-moves fixture/payload/result JSON (and, since the 2026-09-28
# parity session, ad-hoc *TraceJS.txt/*.fits diagnostic dumps too) through
# on every real run (RunInitialFitDCP.py, os.makedirs(...,exist_ok=True))
# -- regenerated fresh every time, not test fixtures or reference data.
js/DCPjobData/

# run_both.js writes these fresh on every invocation (writeConfig/
# writeCloudDensityOptionsFile) -- not hand-authored config. Covers both
# the old (run_both_js_dcp_config.py) and current (run_both_jsDcp_config.py/
# run_both_jsLocal_config.py) naming -- the naming changed 2026-09-16ish
# without this file being updated to match.
3KIDNASTests/SingleGalaxyTest/run_both_fortran_local_config.py
3KIDNASTests/SingleGalaxyTest/run_both_fortran_local_config_fitting_options.txt
3KIDNASTests/SingleGalaxyTest/run_both_js_dcp_config.py
3KIDNASTests/SingleGalaxyTest/run_both_js_dcp_config_fitting_options.txt
3KIDNASTests/SingleGalaxyTest/run_both_jsDcp_config.py
3KIDNASTests/SingleGalaxyTest/run_both_jsDcp_config_fitting_options.txt
3KIDNASTests/SingleGalaxyTest/run_both_jsLocal_config.py
3KIDNASTests/SingleGalaxyTest/run_both_jsLocal_config_fitting_options.txt

# One-off TRACE_DUMP_PRECONV-gated diagnostic dumps from the 2026-09-28
# Fortran/JS bit-exactness bisection (see JS_FORTRAN_PARITY_SESSION_
# 2026-09-28.md) -- regenerated on demand when that env var is set, not
# reference data. Named *TraceF.txt / *TraceFile.txt / <Name>FullF.txt at
# the SingleGalaxyTest root specifically (the JS-side siblings live in
# js/DCPjobData/, already ignored above).
3KIDNASTests/SingleGalaxyTest/*TraceF.txt
3KIDNASTests/SingleGalaxyTest/*FullF.txt
3KIDNASTests/SingleGalaxyTest/*_Bootstrap_*_FittingLog.txt
3KIDNASTests/SingleGalaxyTest/TestFits_RunAllThree_*/*/PreConvModel.fits
3KIDNASTests/SingleGalaxyTest/TestFits_RunAllThree_*/*/PostConvPreScaleModel.fits
3KIDNASTests/SingleGalaxyTest/TestFits_RunAllThree_*/*/*_RawGeom_v1.txt

# run_both.js's own result output -- the default report filename and any
# custom name passed via --json (arbitrary per invocation, e.g.
# 20_bootstraps.json) -- regenerated every run, not reference data. Key
# findings from these get written up in BOOTSTRAP_RESAMPLE_DIVERGENCE.md
# instead of committing the raw dumps.
js/tools/run_both_report.json
js/tools/run_both_report.html
js/tools/*_bootstraps.json

# Ad-hoc comparison-run scratch accumulated under this one test-source dir
# (CompareSeeded_fork/CompareSeeded_upstream/KIDNAS_CatTrial/
# KIDNAS_upstream_CatTrial/NewFormulaSmoke subfolders, plus SoFiA-prefixed
# and RTParameters_* variant files) -- unlike sibling WALLABY_* dirs, which
# hold only the three raw cube/mask/VelCube fits files, this one picked up
# years of one-off bootstrap trial output that isn't reference data.
3KIDNASTests/TestData/WALLABY_Test_sources/WALLABY_J100336-262923/
